Times</publisher-name><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.nytimes.com/2007/10/26/nyregion/26infect.html?_r=2&#x00026;scp=1&#x00026;sq=Dead%20student%20had%20infection&#x00026;st=cse"/></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Outpatient management of CA-MRSA skin and soft-tissue infections</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/ncidod/dhqp/ar_mrsa_ca_skin.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Strategies for clinical management of MRSA in the community: summary of an experts' meeting convened by the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/ncidod/dhqp/pdf/ar/CAMRSA_ExpMtgStrategies.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baker</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Large CA-MRSA disease burden mandates prompt diagnosis, appropriate management</article-title><source>AAP News</source><year>2007</year><volume>28</volume><comment>1,9</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Graber</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Karr</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Diep</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Basuino</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>BS</given-names></name><name><surname>Enright</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Hanlon</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Perdreau-Remington</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><art